    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Unbroken Line.</strong> You refuse to let the line collapse.</p><ul><li>When an ally you can see within 6 squares is reduced to 0 Integrity but not killed outright, you can use your reaction to shout them back into formation. That ally instead drops to 1 Integrity, and gains temporary Integrity equal to your Presence value + your tier. Until the start of your next turn, that ally rerolls the lowest die on defense checks.</li><li>Once you use this feature, you can’t use it again until you finish a Soma Break, unless you spend 10 Soft Power marks during a turn to refresh it early (GM’s discretion).</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
